# Nothing that the scripts download or write belongs in the repository (README.md, "Rules that
# bind this work"): EPI is not defaced, and listings and tables name datasets. The scripts take
# their directories as arguments and the README puts them outside the repository; these patterns
# are for the case that one is put inside this folder all the same. The folder itself holds
# Python and shell scripts, README.md and REPORT.md only.

# images and videos
*.mp4
*.png
*.webp
*.gif
*.jpg

# volumes, surfaces and arrays
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mgz
*.mgh
*.gii
*.npy
*.npz
*.part

# listings, tables, logs and other text results
*.json
*.jsonl
*.csv
*.tsv
*.txt
*.toml
*.html
*.log

# FreeSurfer and BIDS subject folders (surface files have no extension)
sub-*/
